Hi,<br><br>I recently got a Baofeng DM-1801 and updated to the OpenGD77 firmware (Jul. 11 2021 release). However, I realized that there is a newer firmware (Oct. 2 2021) available so when I tried updating the firmware through the CPS, it seemed to be successful but upon checking the Firmware Info on my radio, it still shows the firmware as Jul 11. 2021. Therefore, none of the newer features (satellite, position, etc) are on my radio. <br>I tried loading &amp; updating the firmware several times but there was still no change. <br>I'm using Windows 10 and the latest GD77 CPS (Version E2021.09.14.01).<br><br>Hope I can get some support on this issue.<br><br>Thanks and 73,<br>Karl 9W2IXY<p>Statistics: Posted by <a href="http://localhost/opengd77/memberlist.php?mode=viewprofile&amp;u=2124">9W2IXY</a> — Sat Oct 09, 2021 11:27 am</p><hr />
